	"FriendlyName": "HEVC 10-bit Output",
	"Description": "Adds a 10-bit H.265 (HEVC) MP4 output to Movie Render Graph / Movie Render Queue. Frames are piped straight into ffmpeg over stdin while rendering, so there are no intermediate image files and encoding runs in parallel with the render.",
	"Category": "Rendering",
	"CreatedBy": "DSH",
